Z||000013||Archie||07-18-2001||10:25 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChadMan:<BR><B> Am I right just to let this go, or am I a big fat pushover?<BR>.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>On one hand us old guys appreciate your kindness...... <P>On the other hand..... you're a pu$$   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000014||frontal lobe||07-18-2001||11:16 PM||||It wasn't an either/or question.  Yes, you were right to let it go, and yes, you are a pushover!  But nothing wrong with being a pushover in the right situation.<P>Definition time.<P>Meekness-when you have a right in a certain situation, and the power to exert it, but choose not to for the good of someone else.<P>Weakness-you may be in the right, but you aren't powerful enough to exert it.<P>You demonstrated meekness, not weakness.  Very admirable.||||reg||1
Z||000015||FieroHeather||07-19-2001||12:14 AM||||You did a good thing.  Kudos to you.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>Now just dont get a big noggin from all of this praise you've got tonight, ok?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">||||reg||1
